Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《碟中谍4：幽灵协议》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,(匈牙利  布达佩斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,(火车西站)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.35,0:02:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,(杀手 莫洛)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,(俄罗斯  莫斯科兰卡监狱)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你怎么出来了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how did you open your cell door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘘  - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shh! - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,二区开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open Sector 2!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么出来的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快回号子里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back in your cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,听到吗 快滚回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, get back in your cell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你找几个伴儿玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's give you a few friends to play with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.61,0:04:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快叫警卫进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send some guards in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,联系不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我这边好了 你那边怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm set. How's things going down below?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,下水道里还能怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think? I'm in a sewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,门打不开 我们被锁住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doors won't open! We're locked in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.21,0:04:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,拉响警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound the alarm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想关牢房门 可是都关不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost control!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,到底出了什么问题{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.65,0:04:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 情况就要失控了  - 快想办法{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我就位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,开始下一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move to phase 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,(迪安·马丁 《多么意想不到》)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？出了什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? What's happening, Benji?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙没去撤离点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. He's not going to the extraction point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张  他心里有数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay focused. He knows where he's going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不干 我不会打开那扇门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not. I won't. I will not open that door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 快去撤离点 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please go to the extraction point, Ethan. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我懂你的意思 可是我不能 我没有权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what this means, but I can't. I'm not authorized...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快到撤离点去 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the extraction point, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你赶紧去撤离点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the extraction point!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我不开 你就这么一直等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're just going to wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我陪你等\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to wait. Great. I can wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在哪里 我们需要支援 请回话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在哪里 我们需要支援 请回话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 我开 我开 算你狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine. Fine! Fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.55,0:06:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 现在计划全乱了 都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just screw the whole thing up on purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你不能过去 快回来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,请赶快派人支援{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,简 我们的计划有点小变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Jane? We're going to have a slight delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你去那儿干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you want to go in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,波格丹 波格丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bogdan! Bogdan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢尔盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergei?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,现在走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.06,0:07:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对 现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我连他想干嘛都不知道 居然就在帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what he's doing, and for some reason, I'm helping him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,歌曲结束 他能到位就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as he's where he should be when the song ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我们多了个乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we have a passenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.77,0:08:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谢尔盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergei!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,把门都打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open all of them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天呐 天呐 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God oh God oh God. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢尔盖 难道这就是你的计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergei, please tell me there's more to this plan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你是亨特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我是卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's your pal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.02,0:09:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,路上告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you on the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,点燃引线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light the fuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谢尔盖 这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergei, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 波格丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, Bogdan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我不想多嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to bring up the elephant in the room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可这个毛茸茸的俄国佬是干嘛的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what's with the big, hairy Russian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你说波格丹吗？他是我的线人 把他留下 他会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, Bogdan? He fed me intel. If I left him there, they would've killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我把他带出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're gonna give him his freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,通知清扫队了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you call in the sweepers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,已经在路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On their way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 你怎么会来这儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Benji, how is it you're here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我通过实战考核了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I passed the field exam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- DNA测试  - 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- DNA test.  - It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只是例行程序 确认一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's procedure. I'm just confirming it's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.89,0:12:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 用得着吗？  - 谢尔盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're very thorough. - Sergei?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是俄罗斯人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you not Russian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,清扫队来了 扫帚准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweepers approaching! Brooms are out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 收到  - 谢尔盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roger that. - Sergei.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不叫谢尔盖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you not Sergei?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,波格丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bogdan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我一向很照顾朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always take care of my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定一头雾水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Messy bringing him along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,计划很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it went rather well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你会在俄罗斯监狱里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind telling me what you were doing in a Russian prison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要帮我越狱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind telling me why you broke me out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.43,0:12:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是营救任务吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't a rescue mission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, let me put it this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,部长把我从牢里弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Secretary wanted me out of there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,说明外面有大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}it must be pretty bad out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:12:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在找一份文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were after a file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"我们"？谁弄丢的？你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"? Who lost it? You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哈纳韦特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Hanaway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Hanaway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他去截获一份文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a letter drop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,绝密文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classified file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,很简单的拦截任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should have been a simple intercept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道情报员坐哪班车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew which train the courier was on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.94,0:13:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 情报员两分钟后到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, ETA, two minutes on the courier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可有一件事我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was one thing we didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,山猫 你的车已出站六分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobcat, your train's six minutes out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道情报员是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the courier was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快行动 山猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's now or never, Bobcat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,拿文件的情报员 他叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The courier delivering the file, what's his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.63,0:14:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,动手吧 开枪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快把名字告诉我 我不可能跟踪这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a name, folks. I can't track all these people at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,马克·斯特凡斯基 看在上帝的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marek. Stefanski. For the love of God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.15,0:14:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,马克·斯特凡斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marek Stefanski.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Searching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,(锁定)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我来搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.97,0:14:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 没事吧 老兄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you all right, buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.89,0:15:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哈纳韦弄晕马克 拿走了包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanaway dropped the mark and grabbed his bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,歇一会儿 喘口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down. Catch your breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哈纳韦拿到了文件 准备撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had the file in his hands. Easy in, easy out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,文件到手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}File secured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可要这文件的不止我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we weren't the only ones after it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,山猫 看来有人不请自来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobcat, someone else has crashed this party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我被跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,当地警察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Armed hostiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 我来了 桨栓 支援他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang tight, I'm coming! Outrigger, back him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 桨栓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative, Outrigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.01,0:15:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一分钟后在西南角碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rendezvous southwest corner, 60 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哈纳韦的摄像头做了面部比对 发出警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanaway's lens cam drew a facial match and triggered a warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,可太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我该早点告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I. .. I should have told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是我指挥的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my op.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是我派他去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put him in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.65,0:16:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,杀手故意给他留了口气 让我看着他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she left him just alive enough for me to see him die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,认识吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.51,0:16:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,萨宾·莫洛 职业杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Sabine Moreau. Contract killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只收钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works for diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么文件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was in the file?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,俄罗斯的核弹发射密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russian nuclear launch codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.28,0:17:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,IMF一直在找一个极端分子 代号克伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}IMF's been looking for an emerging extremist, code name, Cobalt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人想尽一切办法要引爆核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's determined to detonate a nuclear weapon however he can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,莫洛以前替他干过活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know Moreau's worked for him before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,IMF还知道什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else does IMF know about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as you do now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果莫洛拿到了核弹发射密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if Moreau has nuclear launch codes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那不用猜 这个克伯特绝对是幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can bet Cobalt's gone from a person of interest to enemy number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.51,0:17:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,特工确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent confirmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么会坐牢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why was he in prison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟老婆离婚之后失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He disappeared after he and his wife... You know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为他被调走了 停薪留职\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he'd just been transferred. Put on leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也有传言说 他未经批准杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were rumors, though. Talk of an unsanctioned hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 亨特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Mr. Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你不在的时候 IMF发现克伯特现在或者曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your absence, IMF has learned that Cobalt is or was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.81,0:18:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,俄罗斯情报局的一级核战略师\N{\fnArial\fs30}a level-1 nuclear strategist for Russian intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,因此要想查清他的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, the only way to uncover his actual identity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.81,0:18:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,必须潜入克里姆林宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to infiltrate the Kremlin itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,为了通过检查岗哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to get past their checkpoints,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.65,0:18:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你将扮成安纳托利·费德洛夫将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be impersonating General Anatoly Fedorov.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们认为克伯特会想尽一切办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe Cobalt will do everything he can{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,销毁他的身份记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}to destroy any record of his identity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你将决定是否接受这个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission, should you choose to accept it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.95,0:18:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,潜入高度防卫的克里姆林宫档案室\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to penetrate the highly-secured archive inside the Kremlin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,赶在克伯特前面拿到他的身份资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}and retrieve Cobalt's file before he can destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,最新情报显示克伯特已经上路了 你还有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}New intel suggests Cobalt is already en route, leaving you. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...4小时52分钟...\N{\fnArial\fs30}...4 hours 52 minutes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:18:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,...去执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}...to infiltrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,为了节约时间 我们帮你选好了队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save time, we've chosen your team for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,特工简和班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents Carter and Dunn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,老规矩 如果你或你的团队成员被抓或被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}As always, should you or any member of your team be caught or killed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,部长将表示对你们的行动并不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Secretary will disavow any knowledge of your actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,该消息将在5秒后自动销毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This message will self-destruct in five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,去克里姆林宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going into the Kremlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你是开玩笑吧 真去克里姆林宫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said "The Kremlin."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我太激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very exciting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,能和你搭档执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being out in the field with you, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bit of a dream for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的妆化得很棒 一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love your disguise, by the way. You look just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜 不用戴面具 我一直想戴戴看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shame we're not wearing masks. You know, like, full masks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都戴过 就我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody gets to wear a mask but Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.01,0:21:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.09,0:21:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我一紧张就絮絮叨叨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tense. I babble when I'm nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我又来了 闭嘴 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing it again. Shut up, Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有七个保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, seven security guards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.61,0:21:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,X光机 摄像头金属探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}X-ray machines. Cameras. Metal detectors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,和估计的一样 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what we expected. We can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.45,0:21:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,准备投放 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Releasing in three, two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张 别紧张 快进入状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game face, game face. Kremlin game face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,将军请留步\N{\fnArial\fs30}General...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.81,0:21:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我是叶戈洛夫少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Major Egorov.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.72,0:21:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,请出示您的证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your documents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.77,0:22:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你连自己的长官都认不出来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know your boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,(搜索)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,(拒绝访问)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.97,0:22:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,资料库里没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.35,0:22:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,再扫描一次...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run it again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.77,0:22:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,二等兵...\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Private.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,叶戈洛夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Egorov.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.30,0:22:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,(安纳托利·费德洛夫将军)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.53,0:22:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 将军 我刚才没有认出您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, General. I didn't recognize you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:22:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你要倒霉了 叶戈洛夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to regret this, Egorov.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.13,0:23:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看来一切都很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that went quite well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.55,0:23:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.04,0:24:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.41,0:24:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.19,0:24:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.97,0:24:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.31,0:24:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 对了 我很遗憾 关于你和朱莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, by the way. About you and Julia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.48,0:24:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们分手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, not working out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.65,0:24:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你上次走的时候我就想跟你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to say something before you went away, but. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.15,0:24:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked her, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.65,0:24:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他挂电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's off the phone now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.01,0:27:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,(渲染完成)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.62,0:28:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.04,0:28:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,鸟窝是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nest is empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.39,0:28:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,报告位置 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check in, Team Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.89,0:28:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.06,0:28:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 报告位置 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat. Check in, Team Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.98,0:28:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们到档案室了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you made it to the Archive Room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.12,0:28:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,上尉 有人闯入档案室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain! The Archive Room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.90,0:28:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.32,0:29:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有人黑进了我们的通讯频率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone is piggybacking our frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.74,0:29:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team Leader,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.86,0:29:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我等你的指示 随时待命 准备引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}awaiting your go-sign. Standing by to detonate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.83,0:29:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,中止计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.58,0:29:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在92碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rendezvous nine-two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.88,0:29:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 有情况{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.26,0:29:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 - 快追{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.79,0:30:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快把大门关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.79,0:30:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.67,0:32:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,官方称克里姆林宫地下的煤气总管{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.70,0:32:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,今天突然爆裂{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.29,0:32:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,引发了一系列连锁反应{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.16,0:32:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,目前还不清楚克里姆林宫的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.42,0:32:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哪些部门受到了影响{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.95,0:32:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不过据内部知情人士透露{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.94,0:32:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在克里姆林宫北部角的地面上{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,发现了一个巨大的弹坑{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.06,0:32:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,官方已向公众做出保证{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.01,0:32:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,泄漏的煤气不会造成危害{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.49,0:32:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的媒体和你们的一样不可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our media is no more truthful than yours,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.03,0:32:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,美国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}American.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.12,0:32:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道 引发这起大爆炸的人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we both know that the real cause of the explosion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.12,0:32:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.79,0:32:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,队长 我等你的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awaiting your go-sign, Team Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.05,0:32:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,随时待命 准备引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing by to detonate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.97,0:32:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,碰上我 算你倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst part for you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.26,0:32:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Team Leader,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.39,0:33:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我从不手下留情 你破坏我的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}is I am the man assigned to make you suffer for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.14,0:33:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what you did to my country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.50,0:33:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿是医院...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a hospital. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.65,0:33:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不是酒吧 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a night club.Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.40,0:33:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,米莎 来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Misha. ..help me here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.99,0:33:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,12号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room twelve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.59,0:33:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,听医生说 这家伙能活下来 算他命大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctors say he's lucky to be alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.34,0:33:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只是有点轻微的脑震荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a mild concussion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.64,0:33:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他的健康关我屁事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a damn about his health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.18,0:33:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他是重要嫌疑犯 我们要带他回去问话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have questions that need answering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.48,0:33:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,走路看着点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.69,0:33:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,准备车辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare a transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.61,0:33:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看看那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check over there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.99,0:34:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,跳下去可不明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.08,0:34:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed like one a minute ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.91,0:35:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你找死啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.31,0:35:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 该死的家伙{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.72,0:35:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,全体注意 目标正在朝西边跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All agents! Hot target heading west!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.16,0:36:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,统一保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consolidated Insurance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.41,0:36:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,要帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How may I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.49,0:36:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,萨特20 特工82DE 请求立即撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}SAT 20. Agent 82-Delta-Echo requesting immediate evac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.79,0:36:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,团队会合地点 A113\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rendezvous Alpha 113.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.16,0:36:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,确认 A113\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirmed. Alpha 113.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.09,0:36:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,今天由于克里姆林宫{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.52,0:36:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,地下的煤气总管突然爆裂{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.21,0:36:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,造成多人受伤{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.18,0:36:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,原因可能是煤气管道老化{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.36,0:36:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在广场的下方布满了错综复杂的煤气管道系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Details surrounding the intricate system of gas lines{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.36,0:36:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,其中大部分管道的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}that run beneath the square are still forthcoming,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.15,0:36:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可以追溯到苏联时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the majority of those lines date back to the Soviet era{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.20,0:36:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这些管道至少有三十多年没有更新过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have not been updated in at least. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.87,0:36:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜 安娜 我在想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna... Anna. .. I've been thinking...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.96,0:36:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去 我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like we...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.63,0:37:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出城待上几天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should leave town for a couple of days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.72,0:37:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,带上亚历克斯去度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, you, me. Vacations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.22,0:37:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在吗？ - 马上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now?    - Tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.89,0:37:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么说英语？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you speaking in English?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.47,0:37:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.06,0:37:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就我们三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the three of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.98,0:37:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这起爆炸可能并不是事故 而是一次有预谋的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}...may not have been an accident, but a targeted attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.07,0:37:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在这起爆炸中受伤的人数和损失情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preliminary numbers are just starting. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.48,0:37:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where will we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.90,0:37:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就会统计出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}...to come in regarding those wounded in the blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.24,0:37:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们目前能确认有十一名\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can confirm that 11 tourists...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.66,0:37:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,利奥尼德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leonid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.74,0:37:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,国籍尚不清楚的游客\N{\fnArial\fs30}their nationalities still unconfirmed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.24,0:37:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,已经在第一时间被送往附近医院接受治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been transported to area hospitals for treatment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.04,0:37:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管俄罗斯官方目前仍然将此事件归咎于煤气总管爆裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}While Russian officials continue to blame a gas-main break,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.50,0:37:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但有专家称 从爆炸区域的形状和残骸的大小来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}experts are citing the shape of the blast area and the size of the debris field{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.92,0:37:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这更像是一起有预谋的爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}as more consistent with that of a set explosive,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.84,0:37:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,专家推测 这可能是一次有组织的秘密破坏行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading to speculation that this may have been an undeclared act of aggression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.22,0:37:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管俄罗斯国防部坚持称这是一起事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although the Defense Ministry is maintaining that this is strictly an accident. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.89,0:37:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜 快帮亚历克斯收拾行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, pack a bag for Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.89,0:37:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.69,0:38:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anya! Anya!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.08,0:38:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有活要干\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.65,0:38:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,部长先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.08,0:38:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在俄罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't aware you were in Russia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.49,0:38:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在 克里姆林宫被炸了 我得赶紧走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not. Not since a bomb blew up the Kremlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.50,0:39:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天我飞到这里 来接受俄罗斯总理颁发的友好勋章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday I flew in to accept the Order of Friendship from the Russian Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.09,0:39:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我得飞回华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm headed back to Washington{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.68,0:39:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,向总统递交辞职书\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hand the President my resignation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.35,0:39:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我的首席参谋威廉·勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Chief Analyst, William Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.35,0:39:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有笔吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a pen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.69,0:39:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？  - 笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pardon me?  - A pen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.27,0:39:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.53,0:39:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,克里姆林宫里发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, what happened in the Kremlin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.53,0:39:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他是参谋吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Analyst, you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.70,0:39:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说我的判断有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're implying that I made a bad call...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.53,0:39:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,欧洲男子\N{\fnArial\fs30}European male.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.87,0:39:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,五十多岁 6英尺 180磅 蓝眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifties. About six-foot, 180 pounds. Blue eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.20,0:39:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.37,0:39:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,画得很粗糙 不过根据描述\N{\fnArial\fs30}A crude drawing, but by your description,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是库尔特·亨德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could be Kurt Hendricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.79,0:39:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,智商190 在瑞典特种部队服过役\N{\fnArial\fs30}190 IQ. Served in Swedish Special Forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.46,0:39:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,斯德哥尔摩大学物理学教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor of physics, Stockholm University.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.47,0:39:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,专门研究核残局理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Specialist in nuclear endgame theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.30,0:39:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他太疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asked to resign...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.56,0:39:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,所以被迫辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because he's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.22,0:39:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,克伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cobalt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你得警告克里姆林宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to alert the Kremlin that one of their strategists{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.56,0:40:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,克伯特手上有核弹发射装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}has a nuclear launch device{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.40,0:40:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他的手下已经拿到了启动密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one of his operatives has the codes to activate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.32,0:40:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你凭什么这么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what makes you say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.82,0:40:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.74,0:40:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,从军械库里出来 手里拿了个包\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving the executive armory, bag in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.33,0:40:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为了掩盖行踪 他引发了爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He set off that explosion to cover his tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.70,0:40:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,俄罗斯人几星期之后才会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be weeks before the Russians know it's missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.91,0:40:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,得告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless we tell them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.08,0:40:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't listen to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.75,0:40:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,俄罗斯人一定认为是我们炸了克里姆林宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as the Russians are concerned, we just bombed the Kremlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.34,0:40:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 自从古巴导弹危机以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tension between the United States and Russia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.84,0:40:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,美俄关系还从来没有这么紧张过\N{\fnArial\fs30}hasn't been this high since the Cuban Missile Crisis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.22,0:40:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不论对错 现在矛头都指向IMF\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the blame, right or wrong, points to IMF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.02,0:40:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,总统已经签署执行幽灵协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President has initiated Ghost Protocol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.40,0:40:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,现在IMF不存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire IMF has been disavowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.53,0:40:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那接下来呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happens now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.53,0:40:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 上面要我把你带回华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I've been ordered to take you back to Washington,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.95,0:41:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,国防部会把你诬陷成疯狂的极端分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the DOD will label you as a rogue extremist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.12,0:41:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,把爆炸案的责任全都归在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hang the Kremlin bombing on you and your team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.71,0:41:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,除非...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.79,0:41:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你在从这里去飞机场的路上...\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were to escape somewhere between here and the airport,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.80,0:41:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击了我和勃兰特 然后逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}having assaulted Mr. Brandt and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.55,0:41:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.47,0:41:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你会从一个我不知道的备用藏身处里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would then illegally scrounge whatever material you could{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.89,0:41:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,抢走武器和设备 你的队员也会出现在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a backup supply cache that I've overlooked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.56,0:41:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等待你的进一步行动指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same cache where your team are waiting for further orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.94,0:41:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你可能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you may want to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.07,0:41:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你会消失 这次对话也从来没有发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will then disappear, and this conversation never having taken place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.90,0:41:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没有任何人知道你的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}your intentions would be unclear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.66,0:41:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 一旦你队里有人被抓或被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if any one of your team is caught or killed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.49,0:41:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那他们将会被定性为"煽动全球性核战的恐怖分子"\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will be branded terrorists, out to incite global nuclear war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.42,0:41:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你将决定是否接受这个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission, should you choose to accept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.43,0:42:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 你是我最好的特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, you were my best man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.94,0:42:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉你牺牲这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sorry it's come to this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.77,0:42:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,却落得这么一个结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}after all the sacrifices you made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.61,0:42:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我希望你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't meet again, I just want you to know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.99,0:42:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直把你当朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always considered you a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.53,0:42:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下 开快点 开快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down! Drive, drive, drive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.31,0:42:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.48,0:42:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.98,0:42:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,吸口气 跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a deep breath. Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.82,0:42:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了吗？ - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready?   - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.68,0:43:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.51,0:43:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你等在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.85,0:43:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else am I going to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.78,0:43:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.70,0:43:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨 那边有人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.63,0:44:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,停止射击 停止射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire! Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.55,0:44:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,给我停止射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.14,0:44:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.06,0:44:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你们到底在打什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you firing at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.29,0:44:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,都把枪放下 见鬼{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.56,0:44:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,今天有两个犯人从兰卡监狱越狱了 头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two prisoners escaped from Rankow Prison today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.98,0:44:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,(谢尔盖)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.18,0:44:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(波格丹)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.26,0:44:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this one?...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.30,0:44:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,去查一查\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we know about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.68,0:44:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会管用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would that work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.77,0:44:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你指什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would what work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.02,0:44:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体加照明弹 为什么会管用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flare on the body, why would that work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.27,0:44:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,当然管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.52,0:44:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道 可是...   - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I know, but... - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.44,0:45:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢？你怎么知道那会吸引火力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why? I mean, how did you know that would draw their fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.78,0:45:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 我赌了一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't. I played a hunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.62,0:45:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那你的设想是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right, so what was your scenario?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.04,0:45:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人在水里被岸上人射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, you. .. There's a guy being shot at in the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.87,0:45:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,突然决定点燃一个照明弹游来游去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden, decides to light up a flare and swim around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.13,0:45:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为敌人会怎么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what did you assume they'd be thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.84,0:45:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么想？ - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thinking?   - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.63,0:45:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为他们不会想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't assume they were thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.55,0:45:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会朝一切活动物体射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assumed they were shooting at anything that moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.68,0:45:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我给了他们一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gave them a target. Look, these...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.14,0:45:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没你想得那么多 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys aren't Rhodes Scholars, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.02,0:45:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,部长死了 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really happening, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.48,0:45:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.65,0:45:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好 行了 听到这声音吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what that sound is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.19,0:45:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的车来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our ride out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.07,0:45:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是绿色车厢 47号\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's a green car. Number 47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.54,0:45:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see green!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.16,0:45:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.83,0:45:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.92,0:46:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,找找 47\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, 47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.17,0:46:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.50,0:46:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,47\N{\fnArial\fs30}47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.01,0:46:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.68,0:46:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Ho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.76,0:46:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就是它 载货单\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it. The manifest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.02,0:46:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,请输入密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter your code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.68,0:46:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗷！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.77,0:46:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.69,0:46:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,呀...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.36,0:46:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,请按确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press enter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.19,0:46:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,视网膜扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retinal scanner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.70,0:46:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.20,0:46:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,视网膜扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retinal scan required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.45,0:46:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.62,0:46:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,视网膜扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retinal scan required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.71,0:46:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,特工确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent confirmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.89,0:46:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森？天呐 我以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan? Jeez, I thought you were dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.72,0:46:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 差不多  - 这是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are.  - Who's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.56,0:46:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是班吉和简 威廉·勃兰特 他是参谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents Dunn and Carter. William Brandt, Chief Analyst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.98,0:47:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,参谋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Analyst?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.61,0:47:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,(载入中)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.99,0:47:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,特工确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent confirmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.90,0:47:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,(伊森·亨特的任务指南)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.08,0:47:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,世界最终会怎样毁灭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will the world finally end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.25,0:47:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作就是预知未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my job to predict the unthinkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.75,0:47:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,把数十亿人的生死当作一局棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}To treat the death of billions as a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.92,0:47:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这样过了二十年 我麻木了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After 20 years of this, I was numb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.09,0:47:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我想到了一个新的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until a new question crossed my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.10,0:47:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,全世界毁灭之后会怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens after the end of the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.02,0:47:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你这条线路安全吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure your line is secure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.27,0:47:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,每两百或三百万年...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every two or three million years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.11,0:47:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定这条线路安全吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you certain your line is secure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.28,0:47:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,总会有大灾难毁灭地球上的所有生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}some natural catastrophe devastates all life on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.45,0:47:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可生命在继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}But life goes on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.45,0:47:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,存活下来的生命变得强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what little remains is made stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.12,0:48:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,简单地说 世界毁灭虽然很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put simply, world destruction is an unpleasant,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.21,0:48:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但它是进化的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}but necessary part of evolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.29,0:48:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好奇当人类面对...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens then, I wondered,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.67,0:48:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个世界末日时会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}when mankind faces the next end of the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.13,0:48:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管你用什么样的方法 把他弄到迪拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you have to do to get him to Dubai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.22,0:48:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让他不虚此行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make it worth his while. Just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.81,0:48:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我观察过广岛 长崎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked to Hiroshima, Nagasaki...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.39,0:48:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我等你电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be waiting for your call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.64,0:48:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,废墟上重建起繁荣的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}thriving cities rebuilt from the ashes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.23,0:48:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,人们为此建起纪念碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}monuments to the unimaginable,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.69,0:48:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,并从中懂得了和平的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}dedicated to the concept of peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.23,0:48:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我想到 也许核战争能成为自然秩序的一个部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It occurred to me here that nuclear war might have a place in the natural order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.41,0:48:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,只要它能被人类所控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only if it could be controlled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.91,0:48:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,只要它能平等地触动每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if it touched every living soul equally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.66,0:48:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,IMF认为这个男人 库尔特·亨德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}IMF now believes this man, Kurt Hendricks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.83,0:48:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是个核极端分子 代号克伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the nuclear extremist, code name Cobalt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.84,0:48:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,今天有人看见他带着核弹发射装置离开克里姆林宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today he was seen leaving the Kremlin, with what is likely a nuclear launch device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.89,0:48:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,两天前 萨宾·莫洛在布达佩斯杀了我们的特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days ago, Sabine Moreau killed one of our agents in Budapest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.06,0:49:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,抢走了俄罗斯核弹发射密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}and relieved him of Russian nuclear launch codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.85,0:49:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,情报说 她在36小时后会入住迪拜哈里发塔的酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intel indicates she will check into the Burj Hotel in Dubai in 36 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.56,0:49:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,马吕斯·维斯特伦是克伯特的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marius Wistrom is a known operative of Cobalt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.94,0:49:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯特正在去迪拜的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wistrom is currently en route to Dubai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.36,0:49:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,想要使用发射装置 克伯特需要得到启动密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the launch device to work, Cobalt needs the activation codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.20,0:49:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他派维斯特伦去向莫洛买密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sending Wistrom to buy them from Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.95,0:49:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的部长...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Secretary...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.04,0:49:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.59,0:49:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,总统签署执行了幽灵协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President has invoked Ghost Protocol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.13,0:49:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们什么都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.80,0:49:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没卫星 没安全屋 没供给 没支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}No satellite, safe house, support, or extraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.89,0:49:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们四个和车里的这些设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}The four of us and the contents of this car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.14,0:49:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是IMF仅存的战斗力\N{\fnArial\fs30}are all that remain of the IMF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.89,0:49:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在起 没有人批准任何行动 如果要退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as of this moment, any action is unsanctioned. So if you want out,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.31,0:49:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,马上开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}speak now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.25,0:50:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,目标是亨德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mission is Hendricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.83,0:50:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只有我们能阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all that stands between him and his goal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.75,0:50:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不能有半点疏忽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can be left to chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.09,0:50:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一切和他有关系的人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone connected with this man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.17,0:50:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,都对我们寻找目标具有很高的情报价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}is considered an asset with valuable information about our target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.51,0:50:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道我们还在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can know we're still on line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.01,0:50:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他一旦逃跑 就抓不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lose Hendricks now, we lose him forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.43,0:50:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,说说 什么计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.10,0:50:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,36小时后 维斯特伦会从莫洛那儿拿到密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wistrom will take delivery from Moreau in 36 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.81,0:50:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能让他离开酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we cannot let the launch codes leave the hotel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.02,0:50:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们要靠他找到亨德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need Wistrom to lead us to Hendricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.02,0:50:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,只有拿到密码他才会回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll only do that if he has the codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.19,0:50:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,或者他以为他拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if he thinks he has them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.69,0:50:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的计划就是拦截交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our objective is to intercept the sale,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.03,0:50:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把密码掉包\N{\fnArial\fs30}replace the authentic codes with counterfeits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.36,0:50:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,跟踪维斯特伦 找到亨德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and follow Wistrom to Hendricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.28,0:50:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊 很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's simple enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.70,0:50:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们偷走真密码 留下个山寨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We snatch the codes, we gin up some fakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.99,0:50:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,简 你扮成莫洛 把假密码卖给维斯特伦 大功告成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, you double Moreau, and sell the codes to Wistrom and Bob's your uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.71,0:50:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们要怎么做才能从莫洛那里偷走密码呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you propose we just snatch the codes from Moreau?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.21,0:50:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,把她做掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take her out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.38,0:50:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,对 做掉她 不过得偷偷地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we take her out. But, you know, discreetly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.22,0:50:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,偷偷地？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discreetly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.05,0:51:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.22,0:51:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,她还有用 得留着她 抱歉 我差点忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, she's an asset. Right. I get it. Sorry. Nothing left to chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.68,0:51:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才就是随口一说 别把我的话当真\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said. .. I'm spitballing. It's not all gonna be gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.23,0:51:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不能动维斯特伦  - 行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't touch Wistrom. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.98,0:51:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,莫洛也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.32,0:51:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,她要为哈纳韦的死负责 不过我们得先解决亨德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll answer for Hanaway, but it has to be when I say. After we hit Hendricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.24,0:51:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,只带必需品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only pack what we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.54,0:51:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 不过多带点备着也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, absolutely. Only pack what we... You never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.13,0:51:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,(阿联酋  迪拜)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.03,0:51:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就算我们能冒充维斯特伦和莫洛...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So even if we can double Wistrom and Moreau,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.20,0:52:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么让他们待在不同的房间..\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do we keep them in separate rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.41,0:52:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,却以为在同一个房间里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}while having them think that they're in the same room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.20,0:52:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要给酒店整整容\N{\fnArial\fs30}We give the hotel a facelift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.41,0:52:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯特伦会以为他到了莫洛的套房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wistrom will think he's arriving at Moreau's suite,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.21,0:52:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,可实际上他进的是假冒的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, really, he'll be walking into our decoy room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.58,0:52:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会等在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I'll double Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.38,0:52:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,楼下 班吉装成维斯特伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Downstairs, Benji will double Wistrom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.13,0:52:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,戴面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Masks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.25,0:52:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,和真的莫洛见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And meet with the real Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.92,0:52:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.05,0:52:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那我干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.93,0:52:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你？你做助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You? You're the helper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.06,0:52:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,助手 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helper. That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.27,0:52:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没理解错的话 你们要去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so to the extent I understand what you're talking about here. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.56,0:52:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上最高的摩天大楼哈里发塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Burj Khalifa, it's the tallest building in the world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.98,0:52:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,改变它的建筑结构\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you want to alter its infrastructure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.40,0:52:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让两个人以为他们在那儿见了面\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the hopes of convincing two people that they've{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.28,0:52:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可实际上他们并没有真的碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a meeting, which actually really never happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.33,0:52:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.09,0:52:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是骆驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.63,0:53:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你到干洗间了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ETA on dry cleaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.84,0:53:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my way up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.89,0:53:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,离敲门还有34分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, 34 minutes to door knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.56,0:53:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,喔...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, um. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.57,0:54:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我这里稍微有点小麻烦 不过不用太担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is a slight wrinkle, but nothing to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.82,0:54:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过我们得从大楼外面进入服务器机房\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just going to have to go into the server room from the outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.37,0:54:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.91,0:54:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的服务器的防火墙是军用级别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the firewalls on this building's server are military grade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.25,0:54:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我能联系到总部的约瑟夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this would be a cinch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.17,0:54:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就能轻而易举地搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I could call Youssef back at headquarters,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.67,0:54:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不过约瑟夫已经不存在了 我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Youssef doesn't exist anymore, and neither do we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.15,0:54:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,能黑进去 可很费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could hack it, but it would take too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.65,0:54:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,硬接线呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then hardwire in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.50,0:54:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要想进入机房 得通过四层最先进的安全网\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's four layers of next-gen security between us and the server room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.42,0:54:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没办法从大门进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we can get to it from inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.01,0:54:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,进不了服务器 就没办法控制电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can't get to the server, we don't control the elevators,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.60,0:54:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也没办法控制监控摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't control the security cameras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.56,0:54:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,计划还没开始就泡汤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This operation is over before it even begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.73,0:54:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 我们可以从大楼外面进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, we can get to it from outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.77,0:54:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"我们"？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.06,0:54:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我...我操作电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm. .. I'm on the computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.40,0:54:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just, uh. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.23,0:54:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The helper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.91,0:54:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 机房在几楼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What floor is it on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.24,0:54:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在130楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, 130.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.58,0:54:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,130楼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}130?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.46,0:54:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 通风管  - 压敏材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vent ducts. - Pressure sensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.71,0:55:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来不及搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.88,0:55:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 电梯井  - 红外探测\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Elevator shaft. - Infrared sensors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.29,0:55:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,也搞不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.92,0:55:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.81,0:55:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.81,0:55:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 真高啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.74,0:55:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 你的手只要滚动一下就会消除吸力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now remember, it's a rolling off motion that disengages the bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.78,0:55:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,灯是蓝的 就是吸住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the meter is blue, that's full adhesion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.08,0:55:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易记 蓝色 吸住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy way to remember, blue is glue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.29,0:55:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那红色呢？ - 死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And when it's red?   - Dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.83,0:55:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是刀具 还有服务器的接口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your cutter, okay? And your server interface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.79,0:55:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你放背后 一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both going back here. One, two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.96,0:55:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,机房在上面的第十一层 右边第七间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Ethan, the hotel server is eleven stories up and seven units over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.92,0:55:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,行吗？通讯检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Comm check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.63,0:55:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.76,0:55:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.85,0:56:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,离敲门还有26分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 26 minutes to door knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.44,0:56:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.24,0:57:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还有25分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}25 minutes to door knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.43,0:57:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.11,0:57:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 那是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.95,0:57:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是沙暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sandstorm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.79,0:57:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,距离还很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long way off, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.95,0:57:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't be a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.29,0:57:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还有24分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}24 minutes to door knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.80,0:57:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.97,0:57:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是真的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.19,0:58:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还有23分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}23 minutes to door knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.04,0:59:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,到目标楼层了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at server level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.15,0:59:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还有22分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}22 minutes to door knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.73,0:59:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,倒计时 帮不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The countdown is not helping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.24,0:59:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我是着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.52,1:00:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.69,1:00:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 伊森 胜利在望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great, Ethan. You're halfway home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.95,1:00:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,定位服务器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Located server.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.29,1:00:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果连上了 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me we're online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.91,1:00:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们连上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.46,1:00:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这下电梯和监控摄像头全在我掌控之中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I now have control of the elevators and the security cameras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.59,1:00:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,准备装修\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to redecorate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.71,1:00:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你来操作 盯着维斯特伦和莫洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you drive. And look out for Wistrom and Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.48,1:00:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,莫洛提前进电梯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau is at the elevators ahead of schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.73,1:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.57,1:01:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这个门打不开 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't open this door, can we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.28,1:01:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,门？是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.66,1:01:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 你得回到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, you gotta get down here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.83,1:01:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.83,1:01:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有问题吗 伊森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem? Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.34,1:01:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,赶不上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.47,1:01:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,必须赶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.68,1:01:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.45,1:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的绳子不够长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your line's not long enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.62,1:01:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.92,1:02:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有难度\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not easy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.67,1:02:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.76,1:02:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我错过什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd I miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.23,1:02:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,镜头可能会让眼睛有点不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lens might be a little uncomfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.77,1:03:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,它会把捕捉到的图像传到箱子里的打印机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It captures images and transmits them to the printer in the briefcase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.86,1:03:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行了吗？ - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right?   - Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.78,1:03:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一只眼睛看不见 不过没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see out of one eye, but I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.36,1:03:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,连眨两下就是快门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blink twice to activate the shutter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.28,1:03:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,数字是按顺序排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Notice the numbers are in order?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.37,1:03:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,完美的拷贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}A perfect copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.79,1:03:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,数字被打乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the numbers are scrambled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.04,1:03:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,面具呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Masks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.21,1:03:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还要60秒 你确定我不用戴面具吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 seconds. You sure I shouldn't wear a mask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.30,1:03:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我看着一点儿也不像阿拉伯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, 'cause I'm not exactly Omar Sharif.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.55,1:03:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我装法国人 这是追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll play it French. This is your tracking device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.80,1:03:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是追踪目标  - 回形针？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is what you're tracking. - The paper clip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.55,1:03:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's the paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.72,1:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在公文箱里的纸上涂上同位素\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the briefcase. It's coated with isotopes which give off a unique...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.27,1:03:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这样 就算文件换到别的包里 你也能追踪到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just means that you can track the documents even if they switch briefcases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.06,1:03:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,多大范围？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Range?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.14,1:03:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很大 才半英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that good. It's, like, half a mile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.27,1:03:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 不能让维斯特伦离开你的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safest thing to do would be not let Wistrom out of your sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.48,1:03:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Wistrom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.24,1:03:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.40,1:03:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 没有数据库 没法做面部识别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. We don't have an uplink, so there's no facial recognition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.07,1:03:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.83,1:03:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,利奥尼德·李森科 密码破译员\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Leonid Lisenker. Polish-born cryptographer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.58,1:04:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,冷战后 他重新设计了俄罗斯核安全系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}He redesigned Russia's nuclear security after the Cold War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.67,1:04:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他是来鉴定发射密码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here to authenticate the launch codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.75,1:04:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们暴露了  - 这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, he is. We are blown.  - No, we're not blown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.92,1:04:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他一看到伪造的密码 我们就暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we will be as soon as he sees the counterfeit launch codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.17,1:04:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not blown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.01,1:04:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,进电梯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.13,1:04:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,拖住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delay them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.69,1:04:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,重新编程需要多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, how long would it take you to reprogram the case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.52,1:04:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,几秒钟 你要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of seconds. What for, though?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.86,1:04:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做个真的密码拷贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make an exact copy of the launch codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.11,1:04:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 这可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - You can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.78,1:04:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到22楼了  - 拖住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wistrom's on 22! - Slow him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.36,1:04:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do what I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.20,1:04:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才说要干什么 伊森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. Ethan, hang on now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.87,1:04:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 你等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. Just a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.29,1:04:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你想把真的核弹发射密码交给维斯特伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about handing over active nuclear launch codes to Wistrom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.87,1:04:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我们重新编程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Reprogram the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.00,1:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,听着...停!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen... Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.12,1:04:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道自己在说什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen to what you're saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.29,1:04:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你走火入魔了 脑子不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fixating. You're not thinking clearly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.04,1:04:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 绝对不行 我不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna happen. I won't let it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.21,1:04:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,到33楼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}33 and climbing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.63,1:04:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,勃兰特 好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandt, use your head now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.88,1:04:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,目标不是密码 是亨德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mission is not the codes, the mission is Hendricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.68,1:04:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,给他假密码 让他无法启动装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then just let it play out. Give him bad codes. Neutralize him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.18,1:04:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that won't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.31,1:04:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,对恐怖分子来说 失败不过是成功的彩排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failure to a terrorist is just a rehearsal for success.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.98,1:05:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,41楼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}41!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.39,1:05:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,今天让他跑了 明天他又会出现在别的地方接着干\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lose Hendricks today, he shows up somewhere else tomorrow. He finds another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.90,1:05:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,再也没有人会阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}With no IMF to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.48,1:05:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就这一次机会 快把箱子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's now or never. Now, Brandt, give me the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.73,1:05:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的 我们绝不能有半点疏忽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can be left to chance. You said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.99,1:05:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你是参谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the analyst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.15,1:05:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我 他再没有别的机会拿到密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me there's not another way for Hendricks to get those codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.24,1:05:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,50楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}50!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.37,1:05:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 今天来这里是他唯一的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me that this is his only avenue, right here, right now, today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.99,1:05:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是这样 那我就放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me that, I'll walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.09,1:05:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要了  - 不戴面具了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We go without.  - Without masks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.84,1:05:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 简 该走了  - 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jane needs to go.   - Ethan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.21,1:05:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.34,1:05:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你去见莫洛 就不能带武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, you'd be walking in on Moreau unarmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.01,1:05:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你被认出来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face-first. Literally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.34,1:05:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说他们见过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know they've met?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.60,1:05:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 万一见过呢？ - 无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do we know they haven't? - Doesn't matter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.76,1:05:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.35,1:05:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只能走这步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.15,1:06:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,护目镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goggles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.82,1:06:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,万一他们见过呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they have met?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.91,1:06:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.70,1:07:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们谁是维斯特伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you is Wistrom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.78,1:07:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你们谁是维斯特伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you is Wistrom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.20,1:07:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.04,1:07:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我很欣赏你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.31,1:07:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.69,1:07:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,密码在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my codes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.49,1:08:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,钻石在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my diamonds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.16,1:08:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.33,1:08:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的报酬呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my payment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.91,1:08:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,给我密码 就给你报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I see the codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.75,1:08:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张 请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to worry. Come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.25,1:08:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,先喝杯茶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we could have tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.38,1:08:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,莫洛小姐 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mademoiselle. Messieurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.26,1:08:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,先给钻石 再给密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}No diamonds, no codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.09,1:08:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,先给密码 再给钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}No codes, no diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.35,1:08:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.52,1:08:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't come alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.77,1:08:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊里有我们的狙击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hallway out there is a kill-box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.61,1:08:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who we work for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.02,1:08:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,拿不到密码 我们就回不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We come back with the codes, or we don't come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.45,1:08:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那些狙击手怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How good is your backup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.03,1:08:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.53,1:08:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.87,1:08:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,最好的已经被我杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've killed the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.12,1:08:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要加点糖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you care for some sugar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.13,1:08:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 说正事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough. Let's get this done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.13,1:09:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你要报酬 而我要保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want payment, I want guarantees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.13,1:09:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,等他验证了密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he's authenticated the codes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.55,1:09:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我会打电话给你钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make the call and you get your diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.14,1:09:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要不然...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.39,1:09:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都没好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all go home in buckets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.31,1:09:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谁也别想活着出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody leaves this hotel alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.52,1:09:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,把文件拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.33,1:09:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.33,1:09:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,锁住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.67,1:09:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 请原谅 一定有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, forgive me. There must be a key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.68,1:09:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}One moment, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.10,1:09:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Messieurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.65,1:10:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我搞错了 是用密码开的 不是钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mistake. It is a combination, not a key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.74,1:10:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me the numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.37,1:10:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.67,1:11:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,0 0 0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero Zero Zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.44,1:11:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.15,1:12:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,和你们做生意很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a pleasure doing business with...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.49,1:12:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯特伦拿到密码走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wistrom has the launch codes. He's on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.16,1:12:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经照你说的做了 现在 快放了我的家人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I did as you asked. I did. Now let my family go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.91,1:12:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,放了利奥尼德的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release Leonid's family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.41,1:12:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.79,1:12:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以去见上帝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can thank him in person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.01,1:12:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,和你们做生意很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a pleasure doing business with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.36,1:12:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.03,1:12:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,莫洛跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau's on the move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.20,1:12:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我来对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.79,1:12:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,简？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.95,1:13:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她还有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's an asset!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.16,1:13:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要抓活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need her alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.00,1:13:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acknowledge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.84,1:13:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,快回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acknowledge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.22,1:13:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 维斯特伦在电梯里 我没看见利奥尼德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Ethan, Wistrom is in the elevator. I can't see Leonid, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.65,1:13:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 拖住他 给我弄部电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, slow him down. Get me an elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.08,1:13:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,去找利奥尼德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Leonid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.43,1:13:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我锁定维斯特伦了 但我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, I've got a lock on Wistrom. But I can't tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.22,1:13:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他还在电梯里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still in the elevator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.93,1:14:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他在 还在电梯里{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.35,1:14:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.35,1:14:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan. Over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.44,1:14:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.56,1:14:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 我听不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, I lost...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.69,1:14:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 能听见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.32,1:14:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,能听见吗？完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, can you hear me? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.03,1:14:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.33,1:14:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.50,1:14:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看着她  - 干嘛叫我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch her.  - Why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.29,1:14:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我会杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if I do, I'll kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.53,1:14:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,站住 我的队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it, Team Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.82,1:15:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你没想到 我会一直追到这儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think I wouldn't catch up with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.41,1:15:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是敌人 那是个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are not enemies. It was a set-up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.50,1:15:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你的谎言很快就会被揭穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find out your lies soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.71,1:15:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.96,1:15:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那就对不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.32,1:15:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,利奥尼德 班吉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leonid. Benji?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.28,1:15:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你找班吉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.40,1:15:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,找到利奥尼德了 他中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got Leonid by the elevators. He's been shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.36,1:15:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.21,1:15:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. Stay with me. Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.02,1:16:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.95,1:16:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,简 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.36,1:18:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,(无信号)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.70,1:18:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,(信号锁定)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.92,1:19:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.38,1:19:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 风太大了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.45,1:19:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的车{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.17,1:19:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我的车开走了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.18,1:22:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,简 莫洛做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what happened with Moreau, Jane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.76,1:22:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她不肯帮我们找亨德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She couldn't help us with Hendricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.89,1:22:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你就把她推出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's throw her off the building!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.48,1:22:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有推她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't throw her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.60,1:22:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你把她踢出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's throw her off the building!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.81,1:22:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的任务 简\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was not the mission, Jane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.23,1:22:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你的任务是追踪那份文件 找到亨德里克斯 而他现在跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mission was to track the file back to Hendricks, who is in the wind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.28,1:22:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,手里拿着发射密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}with nuclear launch codes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.49,1:22:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能没注意到她拿枪对着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you didn't notice the gun she had pointed at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.37,1:22:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你没有注意到窗子开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like you didn't notice the open window,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.66,1:22:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们又在那么高的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that we're about a mile up in the air!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.62,1:22:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我踢她是本能反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an instinctive move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.33,1:22:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我狡辩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.46,1:22:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在面临核战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking about a nuclear war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.33,1:22:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,莫洛比你重要得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The asset is more important than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.92,1:22:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你凭什么对我的动作指手画脚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you get off telling me how well I executed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.34,1:22:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为自己是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We inherited you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.21,1:22:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你不过就是个官僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a bureaucrat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.26,1:22:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,希望是好消息 他来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better have good news for me. Is he here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.76,1:23:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要告诉你这次的任务是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I need you to tell me what the mission is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.14,1:23:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 登喜路打火机 我会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got it. Dunhill lighter. I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.02,1:23:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有人跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one will be following me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.77,1:23:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己小心 别被人跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make sure no one's following you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.65,1:23:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那些俄罗斯人怎么找到我们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how the hell did the Russians find us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.44,1:23:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你问我干嘛？ - 因为你负责通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you asking me for?  - Because you're communications!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.36,1:23:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你负责掩盖我们的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in charge of covering our tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.19,1:23:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 你绝不能再犯这样的错误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot afford to make mistakes like that now, Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.11,1:23:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经不是技术员了 你是专业特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a technician anymore. You're a field agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.53,1:23:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而你只是个"参谋"\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're just an "analyst."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.16,1:23:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.50,1:23:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是谁 勃兰特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you really, Brandt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.21,1:23:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？ - 什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you asking?   - What am I asking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.17,1:23:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那我换个方式吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see if I can put it another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.05,1:23:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一个身手这么好的特工 怎么会是个参谋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does an agent with skills like that end up an analyst?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.40,1:23:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都有秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we all have our secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.07,1:23:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't we, Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.62,1:24:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你把你的说出来 我把我的告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me yours, I'll tell you mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.21,1:24:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,(屏蔽 无人跟踪)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.93,1:24:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等在这儿 我去见个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have friends in the region. Just sit tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.27,1:24:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我找人送你们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send someone to get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.89,1:24:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,亨德里克斯呢？你的计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Hendricks? What's the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.10,1:24:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,原计划是我们一起阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan was for us to stop him together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.27,1:24:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are you going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.52,1:24:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,改变原计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.65,1:24:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这就完了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.94,1:24:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你要单枪匹马去找他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do, go after him alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.45,1:24:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是什么人 勃兰特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you care to explain yourself, Agent Brandt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.39,1:25:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经去一个国家执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on a protection detail in Croatia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.52,1:25:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密保护线人 一对夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shadowing the assets, husband and wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.73,1:25:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不知道我们的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were never supposed to know we were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.69,1:26:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是一个常规任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whole thing's routine, it was a milk run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.03,1:26:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,三天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.70,1:26:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们听说有一群外国杀手要来杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we caught wind that a Serbian hit squad was after our couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.41,1:26:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我的团队掌握主动权\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my team had it under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.08,1:26:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道他们要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew they were coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.67,1:26:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我总是有点担心 我觉得应该警告这对夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I couldn't shake this feeling that I should warn the couple somehow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.00,1:26:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们有个心理准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to find a way to let them know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.72,1:26:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不过上头有规矩 所以我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, orders are orders, so I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.60,1:26:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天 那个丈夫想离开饭店 出去跑跑步\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, the husband decides to leave the hotel and go for a run,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.06,1:26:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我跟着他 我让两个队友照看他妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I follow him, and I leave two men with the wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.65,1:26:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,等我回来 队友昏迷不醒 妻子不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I get back, my guys are unconscious and the wife is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.70,1:26:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,三天后 警察发现了她的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local police found her body three days later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.66,1:26:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩一部分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was left of her, anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.25,1:27:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我就不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my last day in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.67,1:27:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有办法面对这种生死攸关的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't face another life-or-death situation after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.80,1:27:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那丈夫后来怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened to the husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.47,1:27:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没再见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never saw him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.56,1:27:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,直到两天前在莫斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until two days ago in Moscow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.39,1:27:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,部长把伊森·亨特介绍给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the Secretary introduced me to Ethan Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.86,1:27:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不对吧 我听说朱莉娅甩了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not what happened. She left him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.40,1:27:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我也听到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I heard that one, too, Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.61,1:27:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,可是很遗憾 我当时在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, unfortunately, I was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.95,1:27:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,部长接到电话的时候 我就在旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like I was there when the Secretary got the phone call{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.83,1:27:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森因为极其残酷地杀害了六个外国人被抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Ethan was in custody for killing six Serbian nationals in cold blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.25,1:27:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,未经批准杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unsanctioned hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.46,1:27:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.59,1:27:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disavowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.01,1:27:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,再后来 我稀里糊涂到了迪拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next thing I know, I'm on a plane to Dubai,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.85,1:28:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在犹豫要不要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}wondering the whole time, do I tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.48,1:28:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.40,1:28:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'm responsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.78,1:28:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我能警告他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have warned him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.04,1:28:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该警告他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have warned him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.50,1:28:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.67,1:28:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.63,1:28:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢尔盖 谢尔盖 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergei! Sergei, my friend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.39,1:28:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过我会带他来的 没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I would get him here. Didn't I say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.52,1:28:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know it's him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.73,1:28:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他 你相信我 我相信你 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's him. You trust me, I trust you. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.73,1:28:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.27,1:28:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他救了我 我跟你说过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the guy, the one I told you about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.03,1:28:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 可以把这个打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can take these things off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.37,1:28:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 他是个好人 不过他不像我这么了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. He's a great guy, but he doesn't know you like I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.33,1:29:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,听说 你为美国政府工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you work for the American government.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.79,1:29:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你是军火商\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're an arms dealer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.38,1:29:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 谢尔盖 谢尔盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Sergei. Sergei.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.29,1:29:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他是"独立的防御协调人" 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's "independent defense coordinator." Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.55,1:29:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这是份很高尚的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you are. Very classy job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.59,1:29:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 他是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. He's a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.76,1:29:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,钻石是给波格丹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those diamonds are for Bogdan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.39,1:29:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 无所谓 都给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. It's okay. You can have them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.52,1:29:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我堂兄之间有什么协议 那是你们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever arrangements you made with my cousin is between you and him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.73,1:29:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,找我买东西 就得付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want something from me, you pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.69,1:29:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你误会了 我不是买 是卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You misunderstand. I'm not buying. I'm selling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.69,1:29:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你要卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're selling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.90,1:29:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,卖什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selling what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.24,1:29:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.70,1:29:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那个我自己有 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got all I need, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.58,1:29:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们两国在战争的边缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our countries are on the brink of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.83,1:29:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,打仗好啊 我能发财\N{\fnArial\fs30}War is very good for business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.79,1:29:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,核战争呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuclear war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.76,1:29:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,说下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.93,1:29:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我在找库尔特·亨德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a man named Kurt Hendricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.97,1:29:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能听说过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may know him as Cobalt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.68,1:30:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该知道他想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}In either case, I think you know what he wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.52,1:30:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜他以前八成找你买过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet he even tried to buy it from you at some point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.60,1:30:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,说下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.73,1:30:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他拿到箱子 拿到密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a case, he has codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.57,1:30:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就缺一颗战术通讯卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're worthless without a tactical satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.94,1:30:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道他从哪儿能搞到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know where he'd get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.95,1:30:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这种情报的人通常是潜在的恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man with information like that would be a potential terrorist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.37,1:30:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对你们政府来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to your government,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.41,1:30:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,潜在的恐怖分子等于恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}a potential terrorist is a terrorist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.46,1:30:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you help me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.80,1:30:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友就是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}my friends become your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.93,1:30:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.39,1:30:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.56,1:30:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会告诉你 俄罗斯曾经悄悄地卖了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I certainly cannot tell you that Russia quietly sold...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.69,1:30:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一个淘汰的战术通讯卫星给孟买的电信公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}an obsolete tactical satellite to a certain telecom in Mumbai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.32,1:30:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁出的主意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whoever gave them that idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.32,1:31:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,某个独立的第三方\N{\fnArial\fs30}An enterprising third party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.20,1:31:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,防御协调人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working on commission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.79,1:31:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助老朋友 结交新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helping old friends. Making new ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.71,1:31:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星能关闭吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can the satellite be shut down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.17,1:31:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这需要专业技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would take special skills,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.00,1:31:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人可干不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you cannot do it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.87,1:31:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in the bags?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.58,1:31:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.03,1:31:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么弄到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.91,1:31:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,交了个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.21,1:31:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad we could help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.54,1:31:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could help now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.42,1:31:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 伊森 我们之前...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Ethan, before we...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.38,1:31:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,过去的就让它过去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened, happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.17,1:31:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有机会补救 不过 得赶快行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have a chance to clean this up, but we have to do it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.92,1:32:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,而且要一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have to do it together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.39,1:32:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.52,1:32:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,印度\N{\fnArial\fs30}India.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.03,1:32:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 印度？ - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- India? India?  - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.65,1:32:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.41,1:32:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这飞机真酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love the jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.62,1:32:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没看见车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till you see the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.00,1:32:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,席德洛夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sidorov.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.21,1:32:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}How have you been, old friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.92,1:32:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.01,1:32:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我最近一直在忙别的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been busy with other things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.26,1:32:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我很快就会去抓你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll be after you again soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.76,1:32:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在找一个美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you're looking for an American. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.81,1:32:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.98,1:32:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在找一个两天前被人从克里姆林宫偷走的核弹发射装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're also looking for a nuclear launch device stolen from the Kremlin two days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.23,1:32:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.53,1:32:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我有办法让你一箭双雕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you find both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.78,1:33:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们能达成共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}If... we can come to an understanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.87,1:33:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,布瑞吉·纳特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brij Nath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.16,1:33:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,花花公子 传媒大亨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brij Nath. Playboy. Multimedia tycoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.75,1:33:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,表面上看他的整个网络很先进\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the surface, his entire network is state-of-the-art.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.80,1:33:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是用非法购买的冷战旧货改装的 包括这颗卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's built on illegally acquired Cold War cast-offs, including this, the Novosti satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.76,1:33:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,亨德里克斯要用它发射核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hendricks needs it to launch a nuclear strike,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.64,1:33:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,要赶在他之前把这颗卫星关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have to shut it down before he gets that chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.22,1:33:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,要关闭卫星 就得弄到接入代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to do that, we need to get the access code from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.89,1:33:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这要靠你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way or another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.48,1:33:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我失手 计划就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't, none of this works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.82,1:33:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.03,1:33:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.99,1:33:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我没以前自信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week ago, I would have believed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.99,1:33:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,莫洛的死 我不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you for what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.17,1:33:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她杀死了你心爱的人 这种痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took someone you cared about. That's not something you just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.26,1:34:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,忘不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.01,1:34:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那样感觉好点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it make you feel better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.64,1:34:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,杀死那些杀害你妻子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you killed the men who killed your wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.65,1:34:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,人死不能复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't get them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.91,1:34:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 要想关闭卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, to shut down the satellite,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.24,1:34:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得手动接入中央服务器\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to manually tap into the central server.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.12,1:34:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你从排气管道进去 穿上特制的金属外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll enter through the exhaust vent, wearing this under your suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.83,1:34:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,然后跳进计算机阵列 我会抓住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop down into the computer array, and I'll catch you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.54,1:34:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,把你送到主机室 你黑进控制板\N{\fnArial\fs30}then move you along the relay room and you jack into the panel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.55,1:34:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们装成客人分头进去会场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so we enter the party separately as guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.22,1:34:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森指挥行动 简从阔佬那里弄到代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan quarterbacks while Jane Gets the codes from the billionaire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.68,1:34:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我一关风扇 你就往下跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I switch off the fan, you jump into the computer array,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.81,1:34:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我抓住你 你把发射机接通\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I catch you, you plug in the transmitter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.93,1:34:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森告诉我代码 我来查找亨德里克斯的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Ethan feeds me the codes which I then use to pinpoint Hendricks' location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.69,1:35:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 不过有件重要的事 你没说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but you just breezed over something I think is really important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.94,1:35:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那个计算机阵列 我要往哪里跳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The computer array part, where I just Jump?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.70,1:35:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会抓住你 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I catch you.  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.41,1:35:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 这很难理解吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't. .. Why is that so hard to grasp?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.83,1:35:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.95,1:35:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可那里有25英尺高 而我们用的是磁铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? It's a 25-foot drop. And we're using magnets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.75,1:35:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.83,1:35:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,之前出了这么多问题 我们的设备是不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}In light of our recent efforts, the technology's. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.00,1:35:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的设备很可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The science is sound. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.05,1:35:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是比较担心热度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be more worried about the heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.97,1:35:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？什么热度？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's that. What heat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.89,1:35:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,和普通的电脑一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's like any computer, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.18,1:35:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦你关掉风扇 机器会变得很热\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you switch off the fan, it's gonna get really hot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.27,1:35:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.43,1:35:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一样道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relatively, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.56,1:35:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这我知道 所以我等于是跳进一个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it will. So I'm jumping into a. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.48,1:35:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,烤箱里 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, an oven, essentially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.07,1:35:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 烤箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Essentially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.07,1:35:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我会抓住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um, I'll catch you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.12,1:35:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.00,1:36:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,(印度  孟买)
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.98,1:36:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aapka swagat hai, sir. Welcome, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.16,1:37:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,通讯检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comm check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.21,1:37:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,木星 土星这里听得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saturn's got your five-by-five, Jupiter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.54,1:37:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我是冥王星\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Pluto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.21,1:37:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经到达会场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have arrived at the party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.72,1:37:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.94,1:37:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,把代码弄到手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us that code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.24,1:37:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,金星向目标靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venus moving in on target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.88,1:38:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,上钩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hook's in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.26,1:38:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真有一套啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do make an impression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.18,1:38:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么叫我冥王星？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I Pluto?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.35,1:38:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,它都不算大行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even a planet anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.27,1:38:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嫌它小 你叫银河系啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think Uranus is available.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.10,1:38:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你的嘴真不饶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny 'cause you said "anus."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.79,1:38:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.37,1:38:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,探测车出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending in the Rover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.79,1:38:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's moving to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.09,1:38:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,背对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.67,1:38:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他觉得太容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't want to make it too easy for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.38,1:38:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么这么啰嗦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be talking the whole time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.05,1:39:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,去给所有客人送一杯路易十五特酿香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 20 minutes, I want a glass of Cuve Louis in every guest's hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.51,1:39:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而且要让每个人都带一瓶回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And make sure all of them have a bottle to take home by the end of the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.60,1:39:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.31,1:39:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,感动了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressed yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.82,1:39:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我只喝威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more of a bourbon girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.53,1:39:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫布瑞吉·纳特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Brij Nath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.16,1:39:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临寒舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my humble home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.77,1:39:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,探测车就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Rover's in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.69,1:39:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,涡轮扇降速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spinning down the turbine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.07,1:39:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他在发邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's e-mailing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.78,1:40:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,金星 勾引他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venus. Be Venus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.37,1:40:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,勾引他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be Venus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.00,1:40:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你老公？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.88,1:40:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,男朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boyfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.92,1:40:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,充其量\N{\fnArial\fs30}More of a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.17,1:40:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,算同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}co-worker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.01,1:40:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,土星 准备跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saturn, take the leap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.60,1:40:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.27,1:40:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,跳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.23,1:40:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要跳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumping now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.23,1:40:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现在跳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.36,1:40:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 确定 跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Commit. Jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.70,1:40:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跳 - 跳啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jump. - Jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.45,1:40:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会抓住你  - 快跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I catch you.   - Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.91,1:40:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 你确定不会有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're sure about this suit, right, Benji?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.12,1:40:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.92,1:40:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're pretty sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.80,1:40:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.92,1:41:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.09,1:41:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.51,1:41:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.66,1:41:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,木星 他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter, he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.62,1:41:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你跳了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you jump?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.75,1:41:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉我不该跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I not have jumped?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.62,1:41:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经跳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I jumped!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.92,1:41:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.22,1:41:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我要赌一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm playing a hunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.81,1:41:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别揍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.66,1:42:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.79,1:42:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 没想到你还是个多情的主儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, you are a passionate creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.67,1:42:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想请你看看我收藏的艺术品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to show you my collection of art.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.29,1:42:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在等你邀请我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting for you to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.21,1:42:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你得先找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you have to find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.05,1:42:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.34,1:42:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我上楼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.32,1:42:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你得小心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now be careful,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.90,1:42:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,里面可能会变得比较热\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it's probably getting a bit hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.20,1:42:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,得赶在亨德里克斯前面接通卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get to that satellite before Hendricks does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.55,1:43:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看左边 看上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look left. Look up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.39,1:43:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,像你这种多情的姑娘最迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find your capricious passion intriguing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.39,1:43:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 他不是你的菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you one thing. He's not your type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.64,1:43:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他配不上你 他太冷冰冰了 不像我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Completely not your type. He's completely cold. I'm hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.98,1:43:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们印度男人热情如火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like all Indian men, I'm very hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.44,1:43:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,八点钟方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.57,1:43:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,充满激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot! Very hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.69,1:43:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他在你八点钟方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's at your eight o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.57,1:43:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你越靠近我 就会感觉越来越热\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you move towards me, you're getting hotter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.91,1:43:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,上去 快上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Ow! Ah! Up, up! Up, up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.91,1:43:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Too much, too much, too much!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.92,1:43:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.96,1:43:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你有世界上最好的私人收藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd heard you have one of the finest private collections in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.59,1:43:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,至少是个私人空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at the very least, it's private.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.28,1:44:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,土星 你的情况怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saturn? How we doing in the relay room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.32,1:44:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,已经就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}In position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.03,1:44:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(接通卫星 准备上传)
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.70,1:44:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见卫星了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.83,1:44:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you, gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.17,1:44:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.13,1:44:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我要代码 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need those codes, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.52,1:44:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是切德尔布尔区的真品\N{\fnArial\fs30}All originals from Chhatarpur District.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.86,1:44:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,密教的教徒相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the Tantrics believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.66,1:44:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,生殖轮隐藏了我们潜意识里最大的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Swadhisthana chakra hides our most subconscious of desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.55,1:45:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.38,1:45:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,连接这颗卫星 重新启动它的军事参数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uplink to satellite. Reboot to original military specs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.63,1:45:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,下载病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Download the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.23,1:46:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.56,1:46:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.73,1:46:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,服务器失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going haywire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.07,1:46:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,它在从卫星上下载病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's downloaded a virus from the satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.07,1:46:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,亨德里克斯动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hendricks is killing the server{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.36,1:46:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他想要毁掉服务器\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we can kill the satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.07,1:46:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他在给卫星重新编程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hendricks is reprogramming the satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.24,1:46:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,再过五分钟就能用它发射核弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna have launch capability in five minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.41,1:46:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something wrong?   - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.04,1:46:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,简 来不及了 我们要代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, you gotta move. We need that code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.29,1:46:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就剩我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally we're alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.92,1:46:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,金星 行动吧 把他放倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venus, now's the time. Kick his ass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.43,1:46:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get the code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.43,1:46:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我们俩 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are alone, aren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.27,1:46:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人会打扰我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will interrupt us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.27,1:46:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,动一下 就要了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move and I break your neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.02,1:46:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我卫星的接入代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}The override sequence for the relay station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.69,1:46:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要想活命 就赶快告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it now or never speak again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.45,1:46:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.45,1:47:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,46 82...\N{\fnArial\fs30}46, 82...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.62,1:47:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,93\N{\fnArial\fs30}93.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.00,1:47:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.12,1:47:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太晚了 系统崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system's crashed! We're too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.96,1:47:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他暴露了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. He's revealed himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.67,1:47:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你能搜索亨德里克斯的位置吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, can you pinpoint Hendricks' location?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.51,1:47:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,信号是从6.7英里外的一家电视台发出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Hendricks is signaling out of a state-run TV station 6.7 miles from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.59,1:47:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,给我坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send me the coordinates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.72,1:47:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 勃兰特 快离开那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work, Brandt. Now get the hell out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.47,1:47:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back me up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.64,1:47:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,简 别管纳特了 我们在约定地点碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, tie it off with Nath and meet me at the rally point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.65,1:47:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,做个好梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep tight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.98,1:47:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 班吉 让我直接上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster, Benji! Just straight through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.99,1:47:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.45,1:47:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,直接上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.03,1:47:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,探测车没反应 你难道就不能再耐心一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not responding! A little bit of patience would be appreciated!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.72,1:48:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还没到顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't reach the top!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.51,1:48:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,风大点 再大点\N{\fnArial\fs30}More fan! More fan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.47,1:48:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,再大点\N{\fnArial\fs30}More fan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.93,1:48:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法 已经最大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing I can do! It's maxed out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.89,1:48:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,(涡轮最大转速 警报)
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.20,1:48:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,勃兰特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.50,1:48:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,勃兰特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.25,1:48:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,下一次 我去勾引阔佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, I get to seduce the rich guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.43,1:48:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星军事参数已经启用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite weaponized and online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.77,1:48:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在上传新的认证密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upload the new authentication codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.19,1:48:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,防止中央司令部进入系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock Russian Central Command out of the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.60,1:48:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,隔离潜水艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isolate the sub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.11,1:48:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将只发射一枚导弹 作为对克里姆林宫爆炸案的反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll fire just one missile, an apparent retaliation for the Kremlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.28,1:49:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这足够点燃导火线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should start the ball rolling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.11,1:49:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我在 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.28,1:49:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,启动发射程序要多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long until Hendricks can launch a missile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.47,1:49:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,(卫星重新定位)
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.78,1:49:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,用不了30秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less than 30 seconds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.45,1:49:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,找条近路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need another route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.46,1:49:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,左转 走右边的小路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn left up ahead, take the alley on the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.35,1:49:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,上传完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have uplink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.13,1:49:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,(发射程序启动)
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.07,1:49:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 亨德里克斯启动发射程序了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, Hendricks has started the launch sequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.74,1:49:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹多久会发射？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time until missiles are flying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.49,1:49:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.49,1:49:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,到电视台要三分半钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're three and a half minutes out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.50,1:49:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一定能赶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.11,1:50:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,（太平洋中部 麦哲伦海台）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.88,1:50:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,艇长...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.68,1:50:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,快去跟中央司令部确认发射命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connect to Central Command for launch verification.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.27,1:50:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是 艇长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.19,1:50:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,立即开始执行"铁拳行动"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed with Operation "Iron Fist".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.02,1:50:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,发射命令已经得到确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command to Launch is confirmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.19,1:50:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,现在起终止一切联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease all further communication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.36,1:50:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,通话完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over and out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.74,1:50:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,往左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.42,1:50:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.74,1:51:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森 来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan? We're too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.07,1:51:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹上天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The missile's in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.42,1:51:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一定能终止弹头爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be a way to abort the warhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.25,1:51:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,发射装置上应该有终止按钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is one, it'll be on the launch device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.09,1:51:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去拿箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get that case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.14,1:51:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,愿地球能永远和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}May there be peace on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.78,1:51:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,毁掉主机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disable the relay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.78,1:51:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住维斯特伦 快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Wistrom! Inside, inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.31,1:52:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯特伦毁了主机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wistrom destroyed the relay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.32,1:52:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,伊森去追亨德里克斯和箱子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan went after Hendricks and the case, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.57,1:52:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就算拿到箱子 也没法破译终止密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter if he has the case. We can't transmit the abort codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.03,1:52:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,能修好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you fix it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.15,1:52:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 不过没电源也是白搭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. .. It's gonna be pointless if we don't have any power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.99,1:52:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯特伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wistrom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.04,1:52:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 简  - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jane!   - I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.50,1:52:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你受伤了 她中弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you are not okay. She's hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.17,1:52:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你待在这儿 掩护班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here and cover Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.84,1:52:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,班吉 你把线路重新恢复 我去弄电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, get this thing rewired and back online. I'll get the power on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.92,1:52:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.87,1:56:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 把箱子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking that briefcase!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.21,1:56:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.01,1:56:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么还不回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been gone too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.59,1:57:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.09,1:57:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等电源来了 把驱动器装进这个槽里 懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the power comes on, these two drives go into this bay, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.10,1:57:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,任务完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission accomplished!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.48,1:58:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,(任务终止)
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.18,1:58:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.07,1:58:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.04,1:58:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说 我们不是敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we are not enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.75,1:59:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让那个军火商联系我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The phone call from that arms dealer in Dubai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.75,1:59:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望我找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me to find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.38,1:59:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真是让人难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}How else to believe this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.06,1:59:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,去医院吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hospital?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.36,1:59:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,其他方面消息 八星期了 这场争论还在继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in other news, eight weeks later, the debate continues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.40,1:59:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,许多目击者坚持称 他们当时看到的物体是某种飞行器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyewitnesses remain adamant that the object was some sort of aircraft,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.57,1:59:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但是国防部官员声称 那只是一颗体积比较大的陨石\N{\fnArial\fs30}but officials with the Department of Defense insist it was simply a meteor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.54,1:59:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所以会在白天观测到\N{\fnArial\fs30}large enough to be visible during daylight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.45,1:59:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时真的这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.75,1:59:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大喊一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.63,1:59:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"任务完成了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mission accomplished."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.13,1:59:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.25,1:59:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 你真是没创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still corny, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.92,1:59:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那坏蛋准是被你活活气死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine the look on that guy's face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.55,1:59:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨  - 就是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - This must be them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.64,1:59:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟·斯迪克尔 他们是 简 班吉 勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther Stickell, the firm of Carter, Dunn and Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.60,1:59:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我整个周末都在旧金山湾里帮你们收拾残局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I blew an entire weekend on the bottom of the San Francisco Bay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.56,2:00:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你们本事够大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}no thanks to you clowns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.82,2:00:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我来买单\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, you know I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.45,2:00:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 坎大哈见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'll see you in Kandahar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.66,2:00:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for meeting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.91,2:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你撞坏的那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I hear the insurance company's refusing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.29,2:00:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,保险公司不肯赔\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pay the claim on that car you crashed, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.58,2:00:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说 故意让车从百米高空垂直坠下 不属于赔付范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about intentional 100-meter vertical drops not being covered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.30,2:00:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真是奸商啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go figure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.01,2:00:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,腿怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the leg?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.76,2:00:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还能用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.97,2:00:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.35,2:00:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.48,2:00:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.98,2:00:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我一直睡眠不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm not actually sleeping, per se.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.94,2:00:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,常常半夜里出冷汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know. Cold sweats. Middle of the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.44,2:00:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿的人都这么开心 我真是羡慕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these people are just happy and smiling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.11,2:00:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they are completely oblivious to the fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.95,2:00:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,自己差一点就瞬间蒸发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they were almost vaporized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.12,2:00:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,而且要不是因为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it hadn't been for. ..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.83,2:00:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,狗屎运？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumb luck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.62,2:00:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.04,2:01:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想 我们没准备 没情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look, we were unprepared, in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.04,2:01:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,也没支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disavowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.63,2:01:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候唯一运转正常的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only thing that functioned properly on that mission{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.84,2:01:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就只有这个团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}was this team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.35,2:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道是怎么撑过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how we ended up together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.73,2:01:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但是成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm glad we did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.69,2:01:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你们自己决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your missions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.82,2:01:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose to accept them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.20,2:01:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.25,2:01:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没什么任务比上次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously. It's not as if any mission{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.92,2:01:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,更危险 更困难吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna be rougher than the last one, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.17,2:01:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.88,2:01:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别又是炸弹 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bomb. .. Is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.90,2:02:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.53,2:02:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.61,2:02:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,亨特特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.74,2:02:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,卡特特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.75,2:02:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,勃兰特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.42,2:02:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有拿那个电话 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not picking up that phone, Ethan,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.09,2:02:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你可能不希望我参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I don't think you want me in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.59,2:02:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你妻子死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your wife is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.76,2:02:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there in Croatia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.73,2:02:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我去那里执行一个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there for one reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.27,2:02:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.23,2:02:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 我失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.24,2:02:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的任务是保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my job to protect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.49,2:02:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道她死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know she's dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.33,2:03:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,找到尸体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.91,2:03:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.79,2:03:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed those Serbians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.96,2:03:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,为了救她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to get her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.13,2:03:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你被送进监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were sent to Rankow Prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.75,2:03:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我自愿做出的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a sacrifice I was willing to make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.63,2:03:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,IMF怀疑监狱里有亨德里克斯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}IMF suspected Hendricks had people in Rankow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.14,2:03:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,杀手的死为你坐牢提供了理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And six dead Serbians was the ideal cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.64,2:03:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,也算为民除害吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waste not, want not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.49,2:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,部长从没告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Secretary never told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.87,2:03:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我接受兰卡监狱的任务只有一个条件:\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accepted the Rankow Prison mission on one condition:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.84,2:03:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不能有人知道她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That no one could know she was still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.63,2:03:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可你告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're telling me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.02,2:04:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候发现我去过那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you find out that I was in Croatia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.19,2:04:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,从印度回来我查了档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled your file after India.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.02,2:04:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.19,2:04:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你伪造了你妻子的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you had to fake your wife's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.57,2:04:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,和我在一起 她永远不会安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we were together, she could never be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.91,2:04:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,勃兰特 保护她不是你的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your job to protect her, Brandt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.21,2:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.71,2:04:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.71,2:04:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.34,2:04:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.44,2:05:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.13,2:06:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好 亨特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Mr. Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.30,2:06:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,36小时前 我们的军方通讯网络遭到破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}36 hours ago, there was a breach in our military's communication network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.80,2:06:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,现在一个叫辛迪加的新兴恐怖组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, an emerging terror organization known as The Syndicate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.31,2:06:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,控制了我们整个无人舰队 他们的目的还不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}has control of our entire drone fleet. Their targets: Unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.27,2:06:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你将决定是否接受这个任务...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission, should you choose to accept it...{\r}
